  aor1776_hre_centralize_3:0 "Unite the Empire"
- aor1776_hre_centralize_3_desc:0 "Annex all remaining imperial crown lands into the Emperor’s country, including their possessions outside the registered imperial perimeter. This is actual unification, not a province-marker change. Requires all four principles III, cohesion ≥75, two years since the previous stage/opening and peace for every member."
