  je_aor1776_hre_centralization:0 "The reform of the Empire"
- je_aor1776_hre_centralization_reason:0 "Four institutions have matured. The Emperor may now negotiate a closer constitution: autonomous protectorates, crown lands, then unification. Reforms are decisions, not automatic annexations. External personal unions must first be settled through the imperial liberation mechanisms."
